   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T14:05:55+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "Gen 20 has no time cue to date it. I chain it on Gen 19's last Abraham scene (19:27-28) with a wide margin. Mamre as starting point is inferred from 18:1 and 19:27; the text only says 'from there'. Isaac's birth (21:2) is promised for the next season after Gen 18, which bounds the whole story to under a year."
   ],
   "history": [
    {
     "status": "approved",
     "at": "2026-11-02T14:07:38+00:00",
     "note": "[consider] If revised: give an offset of about a month with a one-month margin so the window starts at the anchor; 'sojourns' is closer to וַיָּגָר than 'settles' in the title. (GEN.20.1: \"journeyed from thence toward the south country, and dwelled between Kadesh and Shur, and sojourned in Gerar\")",
     "by": "urim-critic@3 · claude-opus-5-5"
    }
